    "Only current raw Page setData callback-bearing calls are observed. Custom-wrapper/native queues are outside this boundary.",
    "Debug-disabled post-Play scalar screenshots are absent. Debug-enabled values must not be attributed to the debug-disabled run.",
    "The 15-second recording is retained and hashed but has not been fully reviewed; screenshot review is not full video review.",
    "The failed pause sent no input and must not be recorded as a successful pause. Later exit history does not establish an exact playback-crash process/time or OOM cause.",
